{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000918","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000918"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000918","label":"袁盎","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"袁盎","mention_ids":["c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0227","c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0077"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0227","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p036","quote":"袁盎"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0077","chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p004","quote":"袁盎"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000918","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000918","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji011-013","person_id":"cbr-p000918","surfaces":["袁盎"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-010-wendi","c-shiji-011-jingdi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p036","quote":"孝文帝從代來，即位二十三年，宮室苑囿狗馬服御無所增益，有不便，輒弛以利民。嘗欲作露臺，召匠計之，直百金。上曰：「百金中民十家之產，吾奉先帝宮室，常恐羞之，何以臺為！」上常衣綈衣，所幸慎夫人，令衣不得曳地，幃帳不得文繡，以示敦樸，為天下先。治霸陵皆以瓦器，不得以金銀銅錫為飾，不治墳，欲為省，毋煩民。南越王尉佗自立為武帝，然上召貴尉佗兄弟，以德報之，佗遂去帝稱臣。與匈奴和親，匈奴背約入盜，然令邊備守，不發兵深入，惡煩苦百姓。吳王詐病不朝，就賜幾杖。群臣如袁盎等稱說雖切，常假借用之。群臣如張武等受賂遺金錢，覺，上乃發御府金錢賜之，以愧其心，弗下吏。專務以德化民，是以海內殷富，興於禮義。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p004","quote":"三年正月乙巳，赦天下。長星出西方。天火燔雒陽東宮大殿城室。吳王濞、楚王戊、趙王遂、膠西王卬、濟南王辟光、菑川王賢、膠東王雄渠反，發兵西鄉。天子為誅晁錯，遣袁盎諭告，不止，遂西圍梁。上乃遣大將軍竇嬰、太尉周亞夫將兵誅之。六月乙亥。赦亡軍及楚元王子藝等與謀反者。封大將軍竇嬰為魏其侯。立楚元王子平陸侯禮為楚王。立皇子端為膠西王，子勝為中山王。徙濟北王志為菑川王，淮陽王餘為魯王，汝南王非為江都王。齊王將廬、燕王嘉皆薨。"}],"rationale":"所列景帝朝職事、分封、家族與前卷接任敘事暫定相接；同名不作全庫替換，未名者不補姓名，仍待異源覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p036","text":"孝文帝從代來，即位二十三年，宮室苑囿狗馬服御無所增益，有不便，輒弛以利民。嘗欲作露臺，召匠計之，直百金。上曰：「百金中民十家之產，吾奉先帝宮室，常恐羞之，何以臺為！」上常衣綈衣，所幸慎夫人，令衣不得曳地，幃帳不得文繡，以示敦樸，為天下先。治霸陵皆以瓦器，不得以金銀銅錫為飾，不治墳，欲為省，毋煩民。南越王尉佗自立為武帝，然上召貴尉佗兄弟，以德報之，佗遂去帝稱臣。與匈奴和親，匈奴背約入盜，然令邊備守，不發兵深入，惡煩苦百姓。吳王詐病不朝，就賜幾杖。群臣如袁盎等稱說雖切，常假借用之。群臣如張武等受賂遺金錢，覺，上乃發御府金錢賜之，以愧其心，弗下吏。專務以德化民，是以海內殷富，興於禮義。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"慎夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"尉佗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000917","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0161","start":161,"end":162,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"尉佗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000917","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0174","start":174,"end":175,"surface":"佗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000917","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0212","start":212,"end":214,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000810","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"袁盎","kind"